        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Werewolf is a distinctive narrative experience that invites you to join Lachie on her quest to understand her newfound identity. Drop straight into an active case, In Media Res style, of one of her paranormal investigations. Piece together Lachie's story through dialogue, a lore book, a diary, and an online blog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story About Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Werewolf uses supernatural elements to explore themes of identity and self-discovery. Through Lachie's journey of learning to live with her werewolf nature, the game presents a thoughtful metaphor for managing mental health, particularly Bipolar Disorder. The Wolf Meter mechanic reflects the daily balance of understanding your limits while still embracing life's experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212520/extras/084b8bf2f99d7ee027945a6f2af1e8cd.avif?t=1788923068\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Playable Short Story:</strong> A simple, intimate narrative experience designed to be experienced in a single sitting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World-Building:</strong> A cozy, relaxing focus on supernatural lore, community, and world-building, opting for an In Media Res in place of a complex plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Choice &amp; Cinematic Beats:</strong> Navigate dialogue and small cutscene moments smoothly without convoluted, stressful plot branching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lachie's Personal Tools:</strong> Casually catch up on who she is at your own pace by reading through her diary, lore book, and blog </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Werewolf is a distinctive narrative experience that invites you to join Lachie on her quest to understand her newfound identity. Drop straight into an active case, In Media Res style, of one of her paranormal investigations. Piece together Lachie's story through dialogue, a lore book, a diary, and an online blog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story About Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Werewolf uses supernatural elements to explore themes of identity and self-discovery. Through Lachie's journey of learning to live with her werewolf nature, the game presents a thoughtful metaphor for managing mental health, particularly Bipolar Disorder. The Wolf Meter mechanic reflects the daily balance of understanding your limits while still embracing life's experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212520/extras/084b8bf2f99d7ee027945a6f2af1e8cd.avif?t=1788923068\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Playable Short Story:</strong> A simple, intimate narrative experience designed to be experienced in a single sitting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World-Building:</strong> A cozy, relaxing focus on supernatural lore, community, and world-building, opting for an In Media Res in place of a complex plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Choice &amp; Cinematic Beats:</strong> Navigate dialogue and small cutscene moments smoothly without convoluted, stressful plot branching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lachie's Personal Tools:</strong> Casually catch up on who she is at your own pace by reading through her diary, lore book, and blog </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
